@startuml Manual Ingestion Trigger Process
title Manual Ingestion Trigger Process

actor Operator
participant SipsaOpsController
participant IngestionTriggerService
participant IngestionTriggerRequest
participant GenericIngestionJob
participant IngestionJob
participant AsyncIngestionService

== Trigger Request ==
Operator -> SipsaOpsController: POST /api/internal/ingestion/run\n?method=promediosSipsaCiudad&force=false
SipsaOpsController -> IngestionTriggerRequest: new(method, force, MANUAL)
SipsaOpsController -> IngestionTriggerService: triggerIngestion(request)

IngestionTriggerService -> IngestionTriggerService: validate request
IngestionTriggerService -> AsyncIngestionService: triggerAsync(request)
AsyncIngestionService -> AsyncIngestionService: submit to ExecutorService

== Asynchronous Execution ==
AsyncIngestionService -> GenericIngestionJob: execute(request)
note right: Same flow as scheduled ingestion

GenericIngestionJob -> IngestionJob: execute(request)
... (same as scheduled flow) ...

== Response ==
IngestionTriggerService -> IngestionTriggerService: build response with requestId
IngestionTriggerService --> SipsaOpsController: IngestionTriggerResponse
SipsaOpsController --> Operator: HTTP 202 Accepted + response

note right of AsyncIngestionService
    Ingestion runs asynchronously.
    Client gets immediate response
    with requestId for tracking.
end note

@enduml
